---
import CustomHeading from "@/components/CustomHeading.astro";
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[75rem] text-center">
      <!-- Eyebrow -->
      <p
        class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-accent mb-3"
        data-aos="fade-up-sm"
      >
        The "White Glove" Promise
      </p>

      <!-- Primary Headline -->
      <CustomHeading
        as="h2"
        text="We're a **Hospitality** Company That Also Just Happens to Clean Carpets"
        svgColor="text-primary"
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-dark mb-6"
        dataAos="fade-up-sm"
        dataAosDelay="50"
      />

      <!-- Body Copy -->
      <div
        class="text-base md:text-lg text-text/80 mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto columns-1 md:columns-2 gap-8"
        data-aos="fade-up-sm"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
        <p>
          Most carpet cleaning companies focus only on your floors. We focus on you. "White glove" means treating your home with the same care and respect we'd show our own. It means clear communication, honest pricing, and professional service from start to finish. The method used by Chem-Dry delivers amazing results, but it's our people who make the real difference.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Three-Column Promise Details -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12 text-left"
        data-aos="fade-up-sm"
        data-aos-delay="150"
      >
        <!-- Column 1: Trusted Technicians -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
            style="background-color: #E6F2FF;"
            data-aos="zoom-in-sm"
            data-aos-delay="200"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8"
              style="color: #005DAA;"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3
            class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center md:text-left"
            style="color: #005DAA;"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="220"
          >
            Trusted Technicians You Can Count On
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80 text-center md:text-left"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="240"
          >
            Our uniformed, background-checked technicians are professionals you can feel completely safe welcoming into your home. No subcontractors, no day laborers—just experienced team members who understand that earning your trust is just as important as delivering clean carpets. You'll know you made the right choice the moment we arrive.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Column 2: Respect for Your Home -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
            style="background-color: #E6F2FF;"
            data-aos="zoom-in-sm"
            data-aos-delay="260"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8"
              style="color: #005DAA;"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3
            class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center md:text-left"
            style="color: #005DAA;"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="280"
          >
            We Treat Your Home Like Our Own
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80 text-center md:text-left"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="300"
          >
            Ever hired a service company only to find scuffs on your walls or muddy footprints through your house? That won't happen here. We take protecting your home seriously: corner guards on every wall, booties on every foot, and mats along every pathway. The method used by Chem-Dry is gentle on your carpets, and our team is gentle on everything else.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Column 3: Honest Pricing -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
            style="background-color: #E6F2FF;"
            data-aos="zoom-in-sm"
            data-aos-delay="320"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8"
              style="color: #005DAA;"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3
            class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center md:text-left"
            style="color: #005DAA;"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="340"
          >
            No Surprises, No Hidden Fees, Ever
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80 text-center md:text-left"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="360"
          >
            We provide a firm, accurate estimate before any work begins—and that's the price you pay. No surprises, no "we found extra stains" upcharges, no hidden fees. If you decide to add services during the visit, we'll discuss the cost first. It's simple, transparent pricing from a company that would rather earn your trust than make a quick buck.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
